.com/\u003e","author_id":"U027UKB8YTW","author_name":"ulwlu","author_subname":"ulwlu","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U027UKB8YTW","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-07-09/2257431412405_ebd2b95527dc4db214d5_48.jpg","text":"こんにちは\n今日は新御徒町の個性的な名店の蕪木に行ってきました。\n\n店内は私語禁止です。1軒屋をお店の世界観に改造したようで、受付を通ると二階の部屋に行くという形式です。\n薄暗く、沈黙ななかで上質な珈琲とそれぞれの珈琲にあうチョコレートを食べるのは本当に素敵な時間でした\n\nチョコレートは1枚1350円します。ついでと思って買ってきました。\n\n\u003chttp://kabukiyusuke.com/\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-gourmet","ts":1627702887.099500,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CCLJFJ58F/p1627702887099500"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UCL78DG68"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/WwgT"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"\u003c@UCL78DG68\u003e さんこんにちは\n現在はベースキャンプ内では試飲できず、豆を買うしかできないようでした。\n店内がとても素敵で、とても悔しかったです。","ts":"1627702582.013700","files":[{"id":"F02AGCBRMU0","created":1627702547,"timestamp":1627702547,"name":"8cThBQcr.jpg","title":"8cThBQcr.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U027UKB8YTW","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":415109,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AGCBRMU0/8cthbqcr.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AGCBRMU0/download/8cthbqcr.jpg","original_h":979,"original_w":2048,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AGCBRMU0-a93680b6c6/8cthbqcr_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AGCBRMU0-a93680b6c6/8cthbqcr_80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AGCBRMU0-a93680b6c6/8cthbqcr_160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AGCBRMU0-a93680b6c6/8cthbqcr_360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":360,"thumb_360_h":172,"thum